  "before_entry": {
    "id": "M26",
    "title_zh": "认知发展与取得的组合解释",
    "title_en": "Cognitive development and acquired compositional interpretation",
    "claim_zh": "取得的组合操作进入沟通、分节、绑定及新使用；行动与访问记录改变后续经历。后得来源关系重释旧命名，日期化证据进一步约束其历史适用范围。经验覆盖与保留边界、错误确信及暂时变化失败保留，完整认知目标未完成。",
    "claim_en": "Acquired composition enters communication, grouping, binding and new use; activity and access records change later encounters. Later source learning reinterprets old naming, and dated evidence constrains its historical applicability. Empirical coverage/retention limits, mistaken confidence and temporary-change failure remain; the full cognitive goal is incomplete.",
    "scope_zh": "取得25项定理／52项审计；构造37／65；传递27／45；分节23／51；绑定23／41；行动场景16／29；经历选择22／46；回溯绑定20／36；历史绑定10／36（最新304项继承定理／549项审计分列）。空间、类别、目录、准则、初次巡查与合作命名仍有给定；历史组合要求身份、时序、校准和变化／扰动范围，不提供新成本账或任意长度史。经验：36人1,508次命名，三秒467次其他注视而零所指，另45次两者零，五秒前类393次；75人451试次主动−配对−1.34个百分点，95%区间[−10.38,+7.69]不证等效。下一重点是来源—时序保持与持续性假设的经验识别，分别测当前依赖及回溯认可；心理实现、演化及意识未完成。",
    "scope_en": "Acquisition 25 theorems/52 audits; formation 37/65; transmission 27/45; grouping 23/51; binding 23/41; enacted scenes 16/29; encounter selection 22/46; retrospective binding 20/36; historical binding 10/36 (latest 304 inherited theorems/549 audits separate). Spatial/category laws, catalogue, criterion, initial surveys and cooperative naming retain supplied premises; historical composition requires identity, chronology, calibration and change/disturbance envelopes, with no new cost account or arbitrary-length history. Empirical: 36 infants/1,508 events, 467 three-second other-without-target gaze cases plus 45 zero on both; 393 former cases at five seconds. For 75 participants/451 trials, Curiosity−Yoked −1.34 percentage points, 95% interval [−10.38,+7.69], not equivalence. Next: empirical identification of source–time retention and persistence assumptions, measuring present reliance and retrospective endorsement separately. Psychological realization, evolution and consciousness remain incomplete.",
